{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411130","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1241113001:1":{"text":"당신 말고도 마을에 당신 또래의 젊은 사람들이 더 있지 않아요?","source_cn":"除了你，村子里应该还有和你年龄相仿的年轻人吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x039FEE8702A4199D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241113002:1":{"text":"당연하지. 하지만 마을에 남아있는 사람은 많지 않아.","source_cn":"当然有，不过留在村里的不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC794793EA0C6D642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241113003:1":{"text":"모두가 아버지가 잘못한 게 없다는 걸 알고 있는데도 “겁쟁이의 자식”이라는 소리를 듣는 걸 견딜 수 있는 건 아니거든.","source_cn":"不是每个人都能忍受“懦夫的孩子”这个称呼，即使他们知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA000A91490AA1C1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241113004:1":{"text":"그들을 탓할 것도 아니야. 탓할 건 다른 사람들이지.","source_cn":"这不怪他们。可恶的家伙另有其人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E178B354510C21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}